### 测试业务模型readonly字段API

### 1. 获取业务模型列表
GET http://localhost:48080/dynamic/model/page?pageNo=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 2. 创建业务模型（可编辑）
POST http://localhost:48080/dynamic/model/create
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "测试模型",
  "code": "test_model",
  "description": "这是一个测试模型",
  "status": 1,
  "modelType": 1,
  "readonly": false
}

### 3. 创建业务模型（只读）
POST http://localhost:48080/dynamic/model/create
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "只读模型",
  "code": "readonly_model",
  "description": "这是一个只读模型",
  "status": 0,
  "modelType": 1,
  "readonly": true
}

### 4. 创建系统类型模型（自动只读）
POST http://localhost:48080/dynamic/model/create
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "系统模型",
  "code": "system_model",
  "description": "这是一个系统模型",
  "status": 1,
  "modelType": 0,
  "readonly": true
}

### 5. 更新业务模型
PUT http://localhost:48080/dynamic/model/update
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1,
  "name": "更新后的模型",
  "code": "updated_model",
  "description": "更新后的描述",
  "status": 1,
  "modelType": 1,
  "readonly": false
}

### 6. 尝试删除只读模型（应该失败）
DELETE http://localhost:48080/dynamic/model/delete?id=2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7. 尝试删除系统模型（应该失败）
DELETE http://localhost:48080/dynamic/model/delete?id=3
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 8. 删除可编辑模型（应该成功）
DELETE http://localhost:48080/dynamic/model/delete?id=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}} 